abstract = {Welcome to SPLASH/ISSTA 2026 in Oakland, California, from 4 to 9 October  2026. This week brings together the 41st ACM SIGPLAN International Conference  on Systems, Programming, Languages, and Applications: Software for Humanity  and the 35th ACM SIGSOFT International Symposium on Software Testing and  Analysis, and we are delighted that you are here to share it with us.   A conference of this size is the work of a great many people. We thank the  entire organizing committee and the program committees of all the events, without  whom this week would not be possible. We are grateful to ACM SIGPLAN and  ACM SIGSOFT for their support, and to our generous sponsors.},
